{"id":"s2.1.10","slug":"distance-area-volume-conversions","title":"Conversion between Distance → Area, Volume","content":"<p class=\"mb-4\">When converting between units of distance, area, and volume, it's crucial to remember to square or cube the linear conversion factor. If a linear conversion is $1 \\text{ unit A} = k \\text{ units B}$, then for area it's $1 \\text{ unit A}^2 = k^2 \\text{ units B}^2$, and for volume it's $1 \\text{ unit A}^3 = k^3 \\text{ units B}^3$.</p><p>For example, since 1 ft = 12 in, then 1 ft³ = 12³ in³ = 1728 in³.</p>","summary":"When converting between units of distance, area, and volume, it's crucial to remember to square or cube the linear conversion factor.","generation_guideline":"Generate a problem converting between units of area or volume (e.g., cubic yards to cubic feet).","questions":[{"id":1,"text":"3 cubic yards = ___ ft³.","answer":"81","kind":"exact","tags":["geometry","conversions"]},{"id":2,"text":"1 cubic foot = ___ cubic inches.","answer":"1728","kind":"exact","tags":["geometry","conversions"]},{"id":3,"text":"9 square yards = ___ square feet.","answer":"81","kind":"exact","tags":["geometry","conversions"]},{"id":4,"text":"432 square inches = ___ ft².","answer":"3","kind":"exact","tags":["geometry","conversions"]},{"id":5,"text":"3 square yards = ___ square feet.","answer":"27","kind":"exact","tags":["geometry","conversions"]},{"id":6,"text":"243 cubic feet = ___ cubic yards.","answer":"9","kind":"exact","tags":["geometry","conversions"]},{"id":7,"text":"3 cubic feet = ___ cubic inches.","answer":"5184","kind":"exact","tags":["geometry","conversions"]},{"id":8,"text":"4320 cubic inches = ___ cubic feet.","answer":"2.5","kind":"exact","tags":["geometry","conversions"]},{"id":9,"text":"1 square meter = ___ square centimeters.","answer":"10000","kind":"exact","tags":["geometry"]},{"id":10,"text":"12 square feet = ___ square yards. (mixed number)","answer":"1 1/3","kind":"exact","requiredForm":"mixed","tags":["geometry","conversions"]},{"id":11,"text":"216 square inches = ___ square feet.","answer":"1.5","kind":"exact","tags":["geometry","conversions"]},{"id":12,"text":"1728 cubic inches = ___ cubic feet.","answer":"1","kind":"exact","tags":["geometry","conversions"]},{"id":13,"text":"$1\\frac{1}{3}$ cubic yards = ___ cubic feet.","answer":"36","kind":"exact","tags":["fractions","geometry","conversions"]},{"id":14,"text":"2 cubic feet = ___ cubic inches.","answer":"3456","kind":"exact","tags":["geometry","conversions"]},{"id":15,"text":"5 square decameters = ___ square meters.","answer":"500","kind":"exact","tags":["geometry"]}]}